48;2;39;40;34m                    \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                 \u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mThe command checks if the \u001b[1;36;40mDATABASE_URL\u001b[0m environment variable is set.                           \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mIf \u001b[1;36;40mDATABASE_URL\u001b[0m is missing, it logs an error and exits with code \u001b[1;36;40m1\u001b[0m.                           \r\r\n\u001b[36m 2 \u001b[0m\u001b[1mEnvironment Variable Missing\u001b[0m: The \u001b[1;36;40mDATABASE_URL\u001b[0m environment variable is not set, causing the      \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0mcontainer to fail intentionally.                                                                 \r\r\n\u001b[36m 3 \u001b[0m\u001b[1mLast State\u001b[0m:                                                                                      \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mExit Code: \u001b[1;36;40m1\u001b[0m                                                                                  \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mReason: \u001b[1;36;40mError\u001b[0m                                                                                 \r\r\n\u001b[36m 4 \u001b[0m\u001b[1mLogs\u001b[0m: The previous container logs confirm the failure:                                           \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                 \u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;248;248;242;48;2;39;40;34mpayments-api starting (build 4.2.1)\u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                            \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;248;248;242;4